WEBVTT

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:11.426
That's strange.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:14.804
Why would Marmalade
leave the Golden Dolphin unprotected?

00:00:14.889 --> 00:00:16.848
Because maybe it's a trap.

00:00:16.932 --> 00:00:18.475
- Or maybe...
- Wait, wait, wait!

00:00:18.559 --> 00:00:19.726
[Wolf screaming]

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:21.978
Yeah, it was a trap.

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:23.480
[Marmalade] Well, well, well.

00:00:23.564 --> 00:00:26.232
If it isn't my prized pupil.

00:00:26.317 --> 00:00:28.234
And you've brought along the governor.

00:00:28.319 --> 00:00:30.945
Or should I say, the Crimson Paw?

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:32.572
[gasps, grunts]

00:00:32.656 --> 00:00:36.242
What an ingenious way
to disguise the Zumpango diamond.

00:00:36.327 --> 00:00:39.287
Hiding it in plain sight.

00:00:39.371 --> 00:00:40.830
You gotta be kidding me.

00:00:40.915 --> 00:00:42.624
What? I'm sentimental.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.125
You always did have panache.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:47.462
And yet,
you still fell right into my trap.

00:00:47.546 --> 00:00:49.672
But how did you know
we'd even be here?

00:00:49.757 --> 00:00:52.884
Oh, I got a little tip... from a friend.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.260
[Snake hissing]

00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:57.347
Hey, buddy. How's it hangin'?

00:00:57.973 --> 00:00:59.390
Snake.

00:00:59.475 --> 00:01:02.477
[laughs]
What can I say? We just clicked.

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:05.939
Oh, yeah? How's it feel to be workin'
for your favorite food?

00:01:06.023 --> 00:01:10.485
Ah, you're just jealous to be missin' out
on the heist of the century.

00:01:10.569 --> 00:01:11.653
It's got everything.

00:01:11.737 --> 00:01:15.365
Betrayal, a meteor, mind control.

00:01:15.449 --> 00:01:16.533
Can I try it on?

00:01:16.617 --> 00:01:19.202
- Of course, partner.
- Nice.

00:01:19.286 --> 00:01:22.539
All the crime
with none of the exercise.

00:01:23.499 --> 00:01:26.042
And what about all that
"Flower of goodness" talk?

00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:27.252
Was it all just a lie?

00:01:27.336 --> 00:01:29.003
Uh, pretty much, yeah.

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:31.005
You see,
I never cared about what's "good."

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:33.049
Only what's good for me.

00:01:33.134 --> 00:01:35.635
Like, say, a billion dollars.

00:01:35.719 --> 00:01:38.429
Ooh! I just got a tingle.
[laughing]

00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.848
[Marmalade, Snake laughing]

00:01:39.932 --> 00:01:41.307
Go bad...

00:01:41.392 --> 00:01:42.642
Or go home.

00:01:43.727 --> 00:01:45.603
Cuddles! Finish them.

00:01:49.650 --> 00:01:51.526
[both screaming]

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.361
[Wolf grunting]

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:57.907
[screams] Poison gas?
Don't breathe it in.

00:01:59.243 --> 00:02:00.285
Wait a second. [sniffs]

00:02:00.369 --> 00:02:01.744
That's not poison gas.

00:02:03.038 --> 00:02:04.497
- [Piranha] Sorry!
- [Wolf gasps]

00:02:04.582 --> 00:02:05.748
[Shark, Tarantula gasping]

00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:07.584
Surprise! [laughing]

00:02:07.668 --> 00:02:08.918
[Wolf] What?

00:02:09.003 --> 00:02:12.547
- Guys! I can't believe it's you.
- You were right, Wolfie.

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:14.924
- We felt the wag, man.
- [Piranha] And the tingle.

00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:16.718
- It's good, right?
- [Shark] Oh, yeah!

00:02:16.802 --> 00:02:18.928
This is super moving,
but can we do this later?

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:21.431
Feels like I got
a rhythm section in my fin!

00:02:21.515 --> 00:02:23.850
[beatboxing]

00:02:23.934 --> 00:02:24.851
[Diane] Come on!

00:02:24.935 --> 00:02:25.894
Spinning blades!

00:02:25.978 --> 00:02:27.103
Oh, yeah. Right.

00:02:27.188 --> 00:02:28.354
Sorry. I got it.

00:02:30.316 --> 00:02:31.733
Guys,

00:02:31.817 --> 00:02:33.651
am I happy to see you!

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:36.029
- [Wolf sighs]
- [Piranha chuckles]

00:02:37.948 --> 00:02:41.451
Now it's time to huff and puff
and blow this little piggy's heist down.

00:02:41.535 --> 00:02:43.286
- [Tarantula] Game over, guinea pig!
- [all cheering]

00:02:43.370 --> 00:02:46.623
With this meteorite,
we will be able to commit crimes

00:02:46.707 --> 00:02:48.541
people have only dreamed about.

00:02:48.626 --> 00:02:50.710
Not bad for a butt rock.

00:02:50.794 --> 00:02:52.879
Once again, it's not a...

00:02:53.797 --> 00:02:56.549
- [gasps]
- Don't mind us, just robbin' this place.

00:02:59.637 --> 00:03:00.887
No, no, no!

00:03:07.394 --> 00:03:09.312
- Here, kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty.
- [cat meows]

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:24.994
[Wolf] Whoo-hoo!

00:03:25.079 --> 00:03:26.496
- [Shark] Yeah!
- [Tarantula] All right!

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:27.622
We did it!

00:03:27.706 --> 00:03:30.208
Now, to get this thing to the chief
and clear your names.

00:03:30.292 --> 00:03:32.502
Weird. Usually,
we drive away from the police.

00:03:32.586 --> 00:03:35.046
Hey, chico, are you sure
we stopped the heist?

00:03:35.130 --> 00:03:36.714
- Yeah.
- Relax.

00:03:36.799 --> 00:03:39.550
Marmalade can't control them
if he doesn't have the meteorite.

00:03:39.635 --> 00:03:41.844
So, who's drivin' those trucks?

00:03:44.848 --> 00:03:46.766
- [chittering]
- [Diane] The meteorite!

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:48.226
- It's still transmitting.
- Uh-oh.

00:03:48.310 --> 00:03:49.310
The charity money.

00:03:49.395 --> 00:03:51.020
Change of plan, guys.

00:03:51.105 --> 00:03:53.606
Webs, is there some way to override
the truck's navigation system?

00:03:53.691 --> 00:03:56.859
We'd need some kind of
magnetized cross-circuit interceptor.

00:03:56.944 --> 00:03:58.987
You mean this?

00:03:59.071 --> 00:04:01.406
Ooh! She just keeps gettin' cooler!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:02.699
Oh, yeah!

00:04:05.995 --> 00:04:07.328
[Wolf] Whoo!

00:04:13.043 --> 00:04:14.377
Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa.

00:04:18.257 --> 00:04:19.507
Oh, no.

00:04:20.217 --> 00:04:21.718
We gotta split up.

00:04:21.802 --> 00:04:23.845
Webs, you feel like a girls' trip?

00:04:23.929 --> 00:04:25.763
Um, yes.

00:04:25.848 --> 00:04:28.975
[Tarantula] Later, boys. [laughs]

00:04:29.059 --> 00:04:30.435
["Go" playing]

00:04:30.519 --> 00:04:32.145
<i>♪ Everything gettin' harder to find ♪</i>

00:04:32.229 --> 00:04:33.771
<i>♪ Everybody jumpin' out of they mind ♪</i>

00:04:34.606 --> 00:04:36.399
I wanna go on the girls' trip.

00:04:36.483 --> 00:04:38.443
<i>♪ But that's where we begin</i>
<i>You feel it ♪</i>

00:04:38.527 --> 00:04:42.071
<i>♪ Mannequins say, "We breakin' the mold"</i>
<i>Breakin' out and we breakin' the codes ♪</i>

00:04:42.156 --> 00:04:44.615
<i>♪ Similar to the Jacques Cousteau</i>
<i>To the depths and you're wet ♪</i>

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:46.951
<i>♪ So your tank explodes, so get it out ♪</i>

00:04:47.036 --> 00:04:48.161
Whoo-hoo!

00:04:48.245 --> 00:04:49.871
<i>♪ Everybody got a target tonight ♪</i>

00:04:49.955 --> 00:04:51.497
<i>♪ Everybody come along for the ride ♪</i>

00:04:51.582 --> 00:04:53.583
<i>♪ All you studs and you duds</i>
<i>And your ladies, let's fly ♪</i>

00:04:53.667 --> 00:04:55.209
- You're insured, right?
- Yeah, why?

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:56.210
[grunts]

00:04:56.295 --> 00:04:57.295
[Wolf] That's... Hey!

00:04:57.379 --> 00:04:58.921
That's my car!

00:04:59.006 --> 00:05:01.758
It's ceviche, baby! [cackles]

00:05:05.304 --> 00:05:06.679
<i>♪ No time to rest ♪</i>

00:05:09.141 --> 00:05:11.476
<i>♪ Just do your best ♪</i>

00:05:12.353 --> 00:05:14.395
<i>♪ What you hear is not a test ♪</i>

00:05:16.106 --> 00:05:18.024
<i>♪ We're only here to make you ♪</i>

00:05:18.108 --> 00:05:20.026
<i>♪ We're only here to make you ♪</i>

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:22.111
<i>♪ We're only here to make you ♪</i>

00:05:22.196 --> 00:05:24.947
<i>♪ We're only here to make you go! ♪</i>

00:05:25.908 --> 00:05:26.908
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:26.992 --> 00:05:27.992
[laughs]

00:05:28.077 --> 00:05:29.994
So long, suckers.

00:05:31.663 --> 00:05:32.622
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:32.706 --> 00:05:33.831
Whoop-bam!

00:05:33.916 --> 00:05:35.375
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:35.918 --> 00:05:36.793
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:37.544 --> 00:05:39.629
[screeching]

00:05:39.713 --> 00:05:40.922
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:41.840 --> 00:05:42.924
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:43.842 --> 00:05:44.884
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:05:46.178 --> 00:05:47.637
- Whoo-hoo!
- Yeah!

00:05:47.721 --> 00:05:49.555
Where'd you learn to do that?

00:05:49.640 --> 00:05:52.183
Well, I'm, you know, kind of a natural.

00:05:52.267 --> 00:05:53.476
Mostly YouTube.

00:05:54.978 --> 00:05:57.146
- Nice work.
- Meet me at the police station.

00:05:57.231 --> 00:05:58.606
Don't be late.

00:06:00.401 --> 00:06:03.569
What do you say
we deliver this butt rock to the chief?

00:06:05.030 --> 00:06:06.739
<i>♪ Just do your best ♪</i>

00:06:08.450 --> 00:06:10.952
<i>♪ What you hear is not a test ♪</i>

00:06:11.036 --> 00:06:12.036
[squealing]

00:06:12.746 --> 00:06:13.955
[Marmalade] No, no, no!

00:06:14.039 --> 00:06:16.416
That's my stolen money!

00:06:16.500 --> 00:06:19.127
What good are you if you can't even
anticipate their next move?

00:06:19.211 --> 00:06:20.920
- Oh, so, it's my fault?
- Yeah.

00:06:21.004 --> 00:06:23.923
<i>♪ We're only here to make you</i>
<i>We're only here to make you ♪</i>

00:06:24.007 --> 00:06:25.383
<i>♪ Go! ♪</i>

00:06:26.301 --> 00:06:28.094
- Chief.
- This better be good.

00:06:28.178 --> 00:06:30.555
Trust me.
You don't wanna miss this.

00:06:30.639 --> 00:06:31.806
[gasps] Look!

00:06:31.890 --> 00:06:33.266
[tires squealing]

00:06:33.350 --> 00:06:35.768
Well, butter my crumpets.

00:06:35.853 --> 00:06:39.188
Can it be?
The Bad Guys are returning the meteorite?

00:06:39.273 --> 00:06:42.024
<i>Perhaps this is the feel-good story</i>
<i>we all need.</i>

00:06:42.109 --> 00:06:43.943
- Whoo-hoo!
- Yeah!

00:06:44.027 --> 00:06:45.778
Do you guys think
they'll throw us a party?

00:06:45.863 --> 00:06:48.990
Yeah. With fireworks,
piñatas and cake.

